{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5635f45596dc0a7b71547c66b20a6dc3caa635e4392ecb314ce3ee4a5eaf688e", "ja": "（『SHADE OF SPADE』のツアーも終盤戦！\nリハーサルは順調に終わり、本番を待つだけだ！）", "zh": "（《SHADE OF SPADE》的巡演也进入最后阶段了！排练顺利结束，接下来只要等待正式演出！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1001_p", "source_sha256": "df46b10eca1ecc171fdf8eeeb742ae367ee47da014423b9a305d0a9210ce63f6", "ja": "あれ？　風花、どうしたんだ……。\n何か気になることでもあったか？", "zh": "咦？风花，怎么了……\n是有什么在意的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ad07ed1a02785a7634b3aad038f12654eae31e080189362d04f96f22d4860867", "ja": "あっ。お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん。\nいえ、リハーサルはバッチリだと思います！", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n没什么，我觉得彩排非常顺利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "05c1a92e680b8e22c7f86e1e618176523e2c47e12ed5849bdc49df1a0d670a53", "ja": "その、みんなといろんな場所に行けるのが楽しくて。\n……厳島神社に行った時のことを思い出してたんです。", "zh": "那个，能和大家一起去各种地方，我觉得很开心。\n……刚才想起了去严岛神社时的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1004_p", "source_sha256": "708eabaf9e702188e3167b3ce77656e0b77e850b3d4c45f307ecdbaa8bb03496", "ja": "厳島神社……ああ！\n能舞台には工夫がされてるって、みんなと話したな。", "zh": "严岛神社……啊！\n我还和大家聊过，能乐舞台上做了不少巧思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "837981d10fc09cde2fa6151e994e3a7351c2964ad912c3f6d95768435582685e", "ja": "ふふっ、覚えてたんですね。……何百年前にも、\nいい舞台を届けたいと思う人がいて。", "zh": "呵呵，你还记得啊。……几百年前，也有人希望为大家呈现精彩的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "371c623afd37102241e947dbc83ca61f0af5814bde53cd7198fc9b8c2a206b30", "ja": "きっとたくさんの人が、力を注いでたんですよね。\nこのツアーの私達みたいに……。", "zh": "一定有很多人倾注了心血吧。\n就像参加这次巡演的我们一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6c262a425c79bf45d80e13db6903b9e1f096ef686e565855b206a35670c190c3", "ja": "そうだな。時代が変わっても、いいものを作ろうって\n思いは、当時の人達と同じだと思う。", "zh": "是啊。即使时代变了，想要创作出好作品的心情，和当时的人们也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6c4135b23ce5b773622e45ee52d267c22d2dfdacca19f5ee168527cee2d45ee5", "ja": "はい、そうですね。今日は西エリアのみなさんに、\n最高のステージをみてもらわなきゃ。", "zh": "是啊，没错。今天一定要让西区的各位看到最棒的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fed99e7833e683ab3acb992b185d24e1d3141c126d94e28edbe891f745469ae2", "ja": "ああ。これまでの集大成だ。悔いが残らないように\nファンの人達に思いを届けてくれ！", "zh": "啊。这是至今为止的集大成。为了不留下遗憾，把我们的心意传达给粉丝们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "18bb7967a946a63d0f894a5a28f866445974cc08c4158a713803987d29812cf7", "ja": "わかりました。『SHADE OF SPADE』の名に\n恥じない最強のステージにしてみせます！", "zh": "明白了。我一定会把这场演出打造成配得上『SHADE OF SPADE』之名的最强舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c0eef0f8af1a338218215cd545cba08f5f2a99d05835e9d6c32bcecf64f6a7be", "ja": "よし、その意気だ！　本番まで時間があるから、\nしっかり休憩して、準備しておいてくれ。", "zh": "好，很有气势！离正式演出还有时间，\n好好休息一下，做好准备吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e3574c5c47795ee6d635c36835f30c2397c868206351a20336186df965b4fe48", "ja": "ふふっ。その言葉、そっくりそのまま\n{$P$}さんにお返しします。", "zh": "呵呵，那句话原封不动地还给{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1013_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c2e5e5091643755975f3b0163ee81c8f2f5626ed01329775798121d28d145df6", "ja": "本番前で忙しいのはわかりますけど……\nちゃんと休憩しないとダメですよ？　あと水分補給も。", "zh": "我知道正式演出前会很忙，但是……\n不好好休息可不行哦？还有，也要补充水分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f2a437d94295b4f8e37803fed43b16d38f4540ba55db5302390827790c26c5a7", "ja": "あははっ……。風花には、全部見透かされてるな。\n少し時間がとれるから、休憩にしようかな。", "zh": "啊哈哈……全都被风花看透了啊。\n刚好能抽出一点时间，那就休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9e8177522cff261b83db4347a78eae4ab2a73d0e480f7ff7c7db5138e5099af6", "ja": "それじゃ、差し入れコーナーに行ってみませんか？\nご当地の名物がおいしいって、みんなが話してて。", "zh": "那么，要不要去慰问品专区看看？\n听大家说，当地特产很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1017_p", "source_sha256": "690f164f745936ab2fe8a6e183fdc97284422b6f78a9d99625c57ef3916c0d18", "ja": "おお、それは気になるな。よし、早速行こうか！", "zh": "哦，那还真让人在意。好，我们马上过去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0323_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2e2039dbc9be5481764c8a56de598bf4fac4d3ba593040496943b43650195a1a", "ja": "はい♪　いい公演を届けるために……\n私達と一緒に頑張りましょうね♪", "zh": "好的♪为了带来精彩的演出……\n和我们一起努力吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
